  "solution": {
    "text": "<img src=\"assets\\st0010_cc9bc11f23cf.png\"><br>\n$\\begin{aligned} & \\text { Area }=2\\left[\\int_0^2\\left(x^2+1\\right) d x+\\frac{1}{2}[5+7] \\times 1\\right] \\\\ & =\\frac{64}{3}\\end{aligned}$"
  }
